# --- credentials -------------------------------------------------------
# Instagram session cookies live OUTSIDE this repo, at:
#     ~/.config/instagram/cookies.txt   (dir 700, file 600)
# These patterns exist so a stray copy can never be committed by accident.
*cookies*.txt
*cookie*.txt
*.cookies
cookies/
*.netscape
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.secret
*.env

# --- scraped output ----------------------------------------------------
out/
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.info.json
*.description
*.jsonl
# gallery-dl's --write-metadata sidecar for each carousel slide (found
# untracked 2026-08-30: *.jpg was ignored but not its .json sidecar).
*.jpg.json
*.jpeg.json
*.png.json
*.webp.json
*.mp4.json

# --- pipeline state/output (regenerable, see PLAN.md sec 6) ------------
# extracted/, jobs/, staging/, pages/ are pipeline working state, not source
# -- same reasoning as media/out being ignored above.
# .yt-dlp-archive.txt is the same class of thing (an append-only "seen" list)
# but was tracked at the initial commit by mistake -- untracked 2026-08-30.
media/.yt-dlp-archive.txt
media/
extracted/
jobs/
staging/
pages/
logs/
*.local.json
*.groq.json
*.ocrspace.json
*.gemini.json

# --- scratch -----------------------------------------------------------
*.raw
*.err
*.html
seen.txt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- local agent handoffs ---------------------------------------------
# Operational notes can refer to private paths and work-in-progress context.
/handoffs/
# Preserve the public repository's exclusion of the raw pilot record.
/docs/superpowers/handoffs/SESSION-3-pilot.md

# --- benchmark gate (Phase B) -----------------------------------------
# state/ is the live registry the bot and worker share; runs/ are archived
# agent outputs. bench.md drafts stay tracked.
state/
benchmarks/*/runs/
